SUMMARY:ABRAXAS: New England’s Premier Santana Tribute
DTSTART:20260903T200000
DTEND:20260903T230000
DTSTAMP:20260826T123144Z
UID:ec74bb02973e74a3f3faef99dfa2c0@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Get ready for a high-energy night of unforgettable ’70s musi
 c as Abraxas\, featuring renowned guitarist Ed Antonelli\, brings the spir
 it and sound of Santana to the stage. The heart of the show is a powerful 
 celebration of Santana’s legendary catalog\, with electrifying performan
 ces of favorites like “Black Magic Woman\,” “Oye Como Va\,” “Mar
 ia Maria\,” “Smooth\,” “Europa\,” and more. Abraxas delivers a c
 rowd-pleasing\, feel-good journey through the iconic Latin rock rhythms\, 
 soaring guitar work\, and unforgettable sounds that defined an era.\n\nSou
 rces: North of Boston\nEvent page: https://northofboston.org/event/abraxas
 -new-englands-premier-santana-tribute/
LOCATION:The Cut\, 177 Main Street\, Gloucester\, MA\, 01930
