BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:History on Tap: Prohibition on Cape Cod - Running the Rum in
DTSTART:20260903T000000
DTEND:20260903T000000
DTSTAMP:20260826T123144Z
UID:8188d74af6024bc78dd84482172c4b@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:During Prohibition\, rumrunning was big business on Cape Cod. 
 Fishermen and farmers headed offshore under cover of darkness to “Rum Ro
