DTEND:20260905T220000
DTSTAMP:20260826T123144Z
UID:72dc003c1706ad8c1ac049765f48b8@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Join guitarist Barry Goudreau\, formerly of the band “Boston
 ”\, to celebrate the 50th anniversary of the debut record that went on t
 o sell 17 million albums. His awesome seven piece band of seasoned musicia
 ns\, the “Engine Room”\, will take you through the hits on the first t
 wo records as well as his other bands\, and classic rock favorites. Don’
 t miss out!\n\nSources: North of Boston\nEvent page: https://northofboston
 .org/event/barry-goudreaus-engine-room/
LOCATION:The Cut\, 177 Main Street\, Gloucester\, MA\, 01930
URL:https://northofboston.org/event/barry-goudreaus-engine-room/
