 e process of distilling Vivaldi’s famous Four seasons in all its orchest
 rational nuance down to two instruments: guitar and fiddle! Bring your own
  questions. This is a fantastic opportunity to meet some of our 2026 artis
 ts up close and have some of your questions answered! Hosted by Maeve Gilc
 hrist.\n\nSources: North of Boston\nEvent page: https://northofboston.org/
 event/salon-session/
