DESCRIPTION:Longtime friends of MASS MoCA Son Lux are kicking off their wo
 rld tour with a concert in the Hunter Center showcasing their forthcoming 
 album Out Into! Across nearly two decades\, Son Lux has earned its reputat
 ion for splendor and sweep\, but Out Into is something different: a punchy
  suite of tactile\, detail-minded songs born from dazzling moments of coll
 ective improvisation.\n\nSources: The Berkshires\nEvent page: https://berk
 shires.org/events-old/son-lux/
