DTEND:20260919T000000
DTSTAMP:20260826T123144Z
UID:a7f07c0a8fad3d4ccb2848cc4348cb@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Save the date for Farming Falmouth's Shape Our Food Future: Co
 nference & Expo - a day of inspiration\, learning\, and community dedicate
 d to...\n\nSources: Cape Cod Chamber\nEvent page: https://www.capecodchamb
 er.org/event/shape-our-food-future%3a-conference-%26-expo/52193/
LOCATION:Falmouth High School\, 874 Gifford St Ext\, Falmouth\, MA\, 02536
