BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Oysterfest In The Port
DTSTART:20260926T130000
DTEND:20260926T170000
DTSTAMP:20260826T123144Z
UID:cf0e2d70ed5f290026ed785edd3805@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:A One-of-a-Kind Farm-to-Shell Oyster Experience This isn’t j
 ust a seafood festival—it’s a chance to meet and taste the best oyster
 s in New England\, harvested the same morning while drinking and listening
  to live music on the historic Newburyport Waterfront. At Oysterfest In Th
 e Port\, you get to taste premier oyster farms from Massachusetts\, Maine
 \, and New Hampshire—and the farmers themselves are here\, shucking and 
 serving their oysters to you while sharing their passion for sustainable a
 quaculture. Taste the regional flavor differences side by side. This is a 
 direct\, ocean-to-table experience you simply won’t find anywhere else. 
 Plus\, bonus tastings from many great local seafood-adjacent vendors! Spoi
 ler Alert: Tickets sell out fast every year. Meet the Farmers\, Eat Their 
 Oysters\, Enjoy the Live Music and Coastal Vibes. Everything You Love Abou
 t Fall on the Coast.\n\nSources: North of Boston\nEvent page: https://nort
 hofboston.org/event/oysterfest-in-the-port-4/
LOCATION:The Tannery\, 75 Water Street\, Newburyport MA\, 75 Water Street
 \, Newburyport\, MA\, 01952
URL:https://northofboston.org/event/oysterfest-in-the-port-4/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Rockport Autumn Market Pop-Up
DTSTART:20260926T140000
DTEND:20260926T190000
DTSTAMP:20260826T123144Z
UID:c06ed3bbd5760527e3b1598ebc54d3@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a cozy fall afternoon at an Autumn Market Pop-Up\,
  a small\, community-style craft fair featuring local makers\, handmade go
 ods\, and seasonal treats. Set in a warm backyard setting\, this intimate 
 event brings together unique vendors offering everything from crafts and h
 ome décor to baked goods\, thrifted finds\, and one-of-a-kind gifts. Come
  enjoy the crisp autumn air\, browse thoughtfully curated stalls\, and sup
 port small businesses in a relaxed\, welcoming atmosphere. Whether you’r
 e looking for early holiday shopping\, a cozy fall outing\, or just someth
 ing fun to do with friends\, this pop-up market is the perfect way to cele
 brate the season. What to expect: * Local handmade and small-batch goods *
  Seasonal fall treats and drinks * Cozy\, family-friendly backyard setting
  * Limited vendors for a curated shopping experience * Community-focused\,
  relaxed atmosphere We can’t wait to welcome you this fall! 🍂\n\nSour
 ces: North of Boston\nEvent page: https://northofboston.org/event/rockport
 -autumn-market-pop-up/
LOCATION:1 Twin Light Circle\, Rockport\, MA 01966\, 1 Twin Light Circle\,
  Rockport\, MA\, 01966
URL:https://northofboston.org/event/rockport-autumn-market-pop-up/
END:VEVENT
