BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Laurent Grasso: Metaphysical Maze Opening Preview Reception
DTSTART:20261107T173000
DTEND:20261107T193000
DTSTAMP:20260826T123144Z
UID:aff30fc68108efa03a3add17efe922@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:MASS MoCA will present Metaphysical Maze \, the largest exhibi
 tion to date in the United States devoted to French conceptual artist Laur
 ent Grasso. Installed in the museum’s iconic Building 5\, Metaphysical M
 aze will take the form of an immersive installation bringing together\, fo
 r the first time\, the artist’s most emblematic films\, along with a new
  commission in progress\, Cosmic Drive \, produced during his research res
 idency at the SETI Institute in Mountain View\, California. On view Novemb
 er 7\, 2026 – January 16\, 2028.\n\nSources: The Berkshires\nEvent page:
  https://berkshires.org/events-old/laurent-grasso-metaphysical-maze-openin
 g-preview-reception/
LOCATION:MASS MoCA\, 87 MASS MoCA Way\, North Adams\, MA\, 01247
URL:https://berkshires.org/events-old/laurent-grasso-metaphysical-maze-ope
 ning-preview-reception/
END:VEVENT
